* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures and stores are binary and must never be line-ending normalised: a CRLF
# rewrite of a SEG-Y fixture would silently break every byte-equality assertion.
*.sgy   binary
*.segy  binary
*.su    binary
*.npy   binary
*.zarr  binary

# The append-only records are prose; keep diffs readable.
DECISIONS.md            text
EQUIVALENCE_LEDGER.md   text
OPEN_DEBTS.md           text
